        "body": "`.wasm` isn't in `COMMON_MIME_TYPES`, so `serveStatic` sends it as `text/plain; charset=UTF-8` on node and with no content-type on web. `WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming()` requires `application/wasm` and rejects the response otherwise.\n\n`instantiateStreaming(await app.request(\"/module.wasm\"))` on node 22:\n\n```\nmain: TypeError: WebAssembly response has unsupported MIME type 'null'\nthis: ok\n```\n\nadded it to the table, with a test that fails on main for web and node.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * `.wasm` files are now served with the `application/wasm` content type.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
